sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant IR as Information Retrieval Agent
    participant R as Risk Analysis Agent
    participant G as Gemini

    U->>O: Financial question
    O->>IR: retrieve(query, top_k)
    IR-->>O: Retrieved evidence list
    O->>R: analyze_financial_risks(query, evidence)
    R->>R: Input validation and grounded prompt
    R->>G: Structured Gemini request
    G-->>R: Raw JSON response
    R->>R: JSON, risk, level, and citation validation
    R-->>O: Validated risk_analysis
    O->>O: Add agent_trace and format final_response
    O-->>U: Source-backed educational response
